    "contact": [
      {
        "raw": "Youth not in employment, education or training (NEET): Shall be figured by the sum of persons aged 15 to 24, who are not in employment, education or training. Youth who are not in employmen, education or training = (Youth outside of labour force who are not studying at the specified time + Unemployed youth who are not studying at the specified time)  Youth NEET rate= Youth not in employment,education or training 15-24 / Youth 15-24 ×100%                                                                                                                            Proportion of youth (aged 15-24 years) not in education, employment or training: Shall be figured by the ratio of the number of youths not in employment, education or training (persons aged 15 to 24) with the number of total youth persons aged 15 to 24."
